---
/**
 * I13 Media row: puts media side by side on the media measure (12-column grid): two `Mock`s of size `half` or `pair`, three of size
 * `third`. Stacked on phones. Each child sits in its own column span.
 *
 *   <MediaRow>
 *     <Mock size="half" … />
 *     <Mock size="half" … />
 *   </MediaRow>
 */
---

<div class="grid-12 measure-media"><slot /></div>
